<http://data.silknow.org/object/ef079347-d3f0-3cd1-8271-dd34a5f0d19f/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nDouble-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a 3-part border with a line of yellow and dark orange chevrons either side of three lines of pattern which create red and dark orange and white and dark orange crosses on a green and light green ground. The central area has a directional design of green and light green straight stems, one with small pink and white flowers alternate with a larger one with 3 tri-lobed flowers in dark brown, yellow, pink and red.  There are small white blossoms filling the ground and there are 8 small blue and light blue rectangles along the bottom."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/ef079347-d3f0-3cd1-8271-dd34a5f0d19f> .

