<http://data.silknow.org/object/ef079347-d3f0-3cd1-8271-dd34a5f0d19f>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nDouble-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a 3-part border with a line of yellow and dark orange chevrons either side of three lines of pattern which create red and dark orange and white and dark orange crosses on a green and light green ground. The central area has a directional design of green and light green straight stems, one with small pink and white flowers alternate with a larger one with 3 tri-lobed flowers in dark brown, yellow, pink and red.  There are small white blossoms filling the ground and there are 8 small blue and light blue rectangles along the bottom."@en , "embroidered net, 1800s, Persian"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/d0e071d8-7d9e-3edb-a483-211c19bffa5f> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e42ef48f-91e8-3b26-afb9-74001230575d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "embroidered net, 1800s, Persian"@en , "Lacis, silk net embroidered with silk.\nDouble-sided embroidery on hand-made dark brown silk net. There is a 3-part border with a line of yellow and dark orange chevrons either side of three lines of pattern which create red and dark orange and white and dark orange crosses on a green and light green ground. The central area has a directional design of green and light green straight stems, one with small pink and white flowers alternate with a larger one with 3 tri-lobed flowers in dark brown, yellow, pink and red.  There are small white blossoms filling the ground and there are 8 small blue and light blue rectangles along the bottom."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/ef079347-d3f0-3cd1-8271-dd34a5f0d19f/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/ef079347-d3f0-3cd1-8271-dd34a5f0d19f/dimension/2> ;
